# ai.wing — Arvig Authorized Retailer · Change Log

Append-only record of structural changes, feature additions and architectural
decisions. Newest entry at the bottom. Each entry notes what changed, why, and
how to revert.

---

## [0001] Initial build — project scaffold

**Stack chosen**
- Next.js 15.5 (App Router) + React 19 + TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/postcss` (CSS-first `@theme`, no JS config)
- Lenis 1.3 for smooth scrolling
- `next/font` (Inter) — self-hosted, no render-blocking font request

**Why:** App Router gives static server components for everything except the
three interactive islands (header, hero ZIP form, reveals), so the page ships
almost no client JS. Tailwind v4's `@theme` block lets the brand palette live
as CSS custom properties, which keeps the token list in one readable place.

**Files:** `package.json`, `tsconfig.json`, `next.config.mjs`,
`postcss.config.mjs`, `next-env.d.ts`, `.gitignore`

**Revert:** delete the repo root; nothing else depends on it.

