## [0004] Content sourced and fact-checked against arvig.com

Every factual claim traces to an official Arvig page.

**Internet (published rates, arvig.com/home-internet-minnesota/)**
- Everyday Essentials — up to 300/30 Mbps — starting at $65.00
- The Happy Medium — up to 500/50 Mbps — starting at $80.00
- Full Speed Ahead — up to 1 Gbps/100 Mbps — starting at $95.00
- Listed prices include $10/mo savings with AutoPay (ACH) + Paperless Billing;
  pricing varies by location. Carried verbatim in `promoQualifier`.

**Arvig Mobile (published rates, arvig.com/forhome/mobile/)**
- Unlimited Max $40/mo · unlimited talk/text/data, HD video, 10 GB hotspot
- Unlimited $30/mo · unlimited talk/text/data, SD video, 5 GB hotspot
- By The Gig $15/mo · unlimited talk & text, 1 GB data, SD video
- $20 activation per line; $3.30/mo cost recovery fee; all plans require active
  Arvig internet service. Promo: up to 4 lines to $0 for a year via a $30/mo
  credit for 12 months on one line per account.

**Television** — Arvig WiFi TV (cloud DVR 10 hrs expandable to 200, Replay TV
72-hour lookback, free HD, up to 7 simultaneous streams, Evo Force 1 / Fire TV
/ Android TV / Apple / web) and the Broadband TV Value Plan (50+ channels;
A&E, Hallmark, Outdoor Channel, C-SPAN, Sony Movies). Both require Arvig
internet. Arvig publishes no rate for either → `priceNote`, CTA becomes
"Call for pricing".

**Home phone** — landline with unlimited local calling; Voicemail, Caller ID,
Call Forwarding, Call Waiting, Phone to Go; optional long distance plans and
toll-free numbers. No published rate → "Call for pricing".

**Cable** — Arvig states it offers cable alongside fiber, describing it as a
hard-wired alternative where fiber is still expanding. Speeds and rate are
address-dependent → "Call for pricing".

**Network facts used in copy** — largest independently owned provider in
Minnesota; HQ in Perham, MN; roots to 1950; employee-owned; 9,000 sq-mile
service area; 150+ communities; more than half of Minnesota's counties;
unlimited data with no caps, throttling or peak-time slowdowns; 100%
Satisfaction Guarantee; Managed WiFi with WiFi 6, ProtectIQ and ExperienceIQ.

**Mobile was NOT omitted** — Arvig offers it natively with published pricing,
so the section stays per the "omit only if not offered" rule.

**Files:** `lib/content.ts`

